<title>BANGLADESH: Trading on Dhaka bourse delayed by protest.</title>
<headline>Trading on Dhaka bourse delayed by protest.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) was delayed by half an hour as hundreds of traders in the kerb market held a protest rally outside the bourse, DSE officials said.</p>
<p>The officials said the protesters shouted slogans against the government and demanded immediate steps to check the falling share prices.</p>
<p>&quot;At one stage the protesters locked the door of the DSE building,&quot; said one official.</p>
</text>
